{"product_id":"edge-smartwatch","title":"Edge Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eThe Edge Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lightweight construction (22g) with a sturdy PC+ABS finish.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid TFT Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch screen with a resolution of 240×284 pixels.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days of regular use and up to 35 days on standby. Quick charging in under 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Burned Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManage calls, messages, and notifications directly from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control for snapping moments.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"Find Phone\" feature for convenience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator, and motion gesture for screen activation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary, drink water, and hand wash reminders.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch TFT screen with 240×284 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days regular use, 35 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Less than 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 9+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 with 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Edge Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Edge \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003edelivers a harmonious blend of functionality and style. With advanced health tracking, seamless connectivity, and practical everyday tools, it fits right into your lifestyle. Whether you're working, exercising, or relaxing, the Edge Smartwatch enhances every moment with its innovative features and long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49894865142038,"sku":"22878","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":49894865174806,"sku":"22879","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":49894865109270,"sku":"22943","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":49894865240342,"sku":"22945","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":49894865207574,"sku":"22944","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/B1_218495a9-8f36-4abf-b51a-64671c0db56e.webp?v=1767865748","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/edge-smartwatch","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}